      <h2>Help with every step of downsizing your home</h2>
      <p>Downsizing after many years in one home is rarely just a logistics problem. There are decades of belongings to go through, decisions about what fits a smaller space, a sale or purchase to coordinate, and family who want to help but live far away. Chayce Properties gives you one dedicated coordinator for all of it, so you are not managing several companies at once.</p>
      <p>Depending on the package you choose, we help you sort and declutter room by room, stage the property for viewings, pack with care, arrange a fully insured removal, transfer utilities, clean the vacated home and unpack and set up the new one. Our Discovery Consultation, from &pound;150, is the best place to start: in an hour you get a personalised plan, timeline and budget before committing to anything.</p>
      <p>We are based in Northampton and help older people downsize across the whole UK, whether you are moving to a bungalow, a retirement village, a smaller family home or closer to your children. Most people benefit from starting three to six months before their target date, though we can work to shorter timescales.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>You stay in charge of every decision about what you keep. We never rush sentimental items, and your family can be involved as much or as little as you like.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

