<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>How do I start downsizing my home?</summary><p>Start by deciding where you want to live and roughly when. Then sort belongings room by room into keep, sell, donate and let go. A Discovery Consultation with Chayce gives you a personalised plan and timeline so you know what to tackle first.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does downsizing take?</summary><p>Most people need three to six months to sort a family home comfortably and time the move around a sale or purchase. Shorter timescales are possible with a fuller-service package.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does downsizing help cost in the UK?</summary><p>Chayce packages start at &pound;995 for packing and removals and &pound;1,850 for a full-service move with declutter support. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;150. Final cost depends on property size and the support you need.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you help with sentimental belongings?</summary><p>Yes. Our coordinators help you decide at your own pace what to keep, pass on or let go, and never push you to make quick decisions.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you help older people downsize outside Northampton?</summary><p>Yes. We are based in Northampton but work with clients across the whole UK.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

